WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.479
Have you ever heard of a treasure hunt?

2
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.652
We did a treasure hunt on my birthday.

3
00:00:13.653 --> 00:00:15.861
My friends loved it.

4
00:00:15.862 --> 00:00:21.036
Bada was crazy about it.

5
00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:27.754
Bada: Hana, could we do the treasure hunt again? Please? Please?

6
00:00:27.755 --> 00:00:29.967
Hana: I am busy right now.

7
00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:32.478
I have to finish my homework.

8
00:00:32.479 --> 00:00:35.218
Bada: Can we do it after you are done?

9
00:00:35.219 --> 00:00:40.259
I will grant you three wishes.

10
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.005
Hana: All right. Hmm.

11
00:00:43.006 --> 00:00:46.722
First, I wish you to clean up the living room.

12
00:00:46.723 --> 00:00:53.296
Bada: Okay!

13
00:00:53.297 --> 00:01:00.066
Bada: Done! I cleaned the living room.

14
00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:01.743
How's that?

15
00:01:01.744 --> 00:01:04.516
Hana: Hmm. Pretty good!

16
00:01:04.517 --> 00:01:08.932
Second, I wish to drink a glass of milk.

17
00:01:08.933 --> 00:01:13.249
Bada: Right away!

18
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:18.722
Here you go.

19
00:01:18.723 --> 00:01:20.230
Hana: Good job.

20
00:01:20.231 --> 00:01:25.263
And last, I wish you to massage Mom's shoulders.

21
00:01:25.264 --> 00:01:29.028
Bada: No problem! Mom!

22
00:01:29.029 --> 00:01:35.088
Mom: Bada . . . Ha, ha, ha . . .

23
00:01:35.089 --> 00:01:39.155
Bada: Is that enough?

24
00:01:39.156 --> 00:01:40.441
Hana: That's enough.

25
00:01:40.442 --> 00:01:43.238
Now, let's do the treasure hunt.

26
00:01:43.239 --> 00:01:48.825
Bada: Hurray! Hurray!

27
00:01:48.826 --> 00:01:54.403
I got three wishes everytime Bada wanted to do the treasure hunt.

28
00:01:54.404 --> 00:02:04.030
He is my brother and I like him.
